+
+has resonances at degrees 0,11,22,33; the actual degree-33 source relation removes that resonance with pivot 1. Retaining every source-image, residual and inverse row gives an abstract 189-direction graph elimination over Q-algebras. Its missing instance maps and cost cannot be supplied by counting agreement among authors. [Blind argument](/tmp/jc2-lane.mprOtd/inputs/ideation-20260906T1030Z-astra.md:95).
+
