+
+**Bottlenecks and composition.** Proof ranking: (1) all-degree coverage plus a uniform polynomial-realization obstruction; (2) source-to-stage8 necessity for fixed-family exclusions; (3) all-m, factorwise K16 product obstruction including b=0; (4) fixed-chart decisions. The24,063→90→64 census is only n≤200; K16(T) stops at t≤8. Sol's D(g)/V(g) atlas discipline supplies no missing map or terminating uniform induction. The charged degree estimate already returns145/227; neither proposal earns a new obstruction label.
+
+CE ranking: (1) produce a genuine candidate or characteristic-zero properness certificate for a complete physical family; (2) make its complete decision/certificate computation affordable; (3) exact all-row witness verification. A nonzero finite Q-algebra witness with all graph and inverse identities suffices; a modular point, numerical residual or subset nonunit does not. A unit excludes only this family pending necessity.
+
+Concrete composition: use Coordinator/Astra/Sol's scalar graph elimination with Sol's explicit nonzero-J constraint, then Fable's calibrated variable projection to search the remaining compatibility equations. Preserve every residual and the inverse. Adopt W-order only after source/code checking; use Opus's rank samples as telemetry, never global elimination licenses.
+
+**Cheapest chosen experiment: one W-filtration circuit instantiation, no solve.** Assuming the pinned source and full-row labels, allocate at most15 minutes implementation/review and one60-second/1GiB emission attempt. These are proposed budgets, not measured runtimes. Emit the rational190-column transformation, selected rows, and triangular DAG in abstract G coefficients; check source reconstruction, forbidden entries, every −2r diagonal, and a deterministic known-target roundtrip `J(C*,G)`. Mutating a diagonal or omitting a residual/inverse label must fail. Retain complete residual labels without expanding source substitutions.
+
+Record nodes, edges, coefficient degree, wall/RSS and verification cost. Existing189 construction/replay measured0.335s/1.538s and its abstract graph42,320 terms; those are comparison data, not a forecast. Any identity failure or cap stops the attempt. A compact verified graph raises priority only for source instantiation/evaluation; it does not license solving. Excessive graph size lowers this schedule's priority. `OPEN[W-CIRCUIT-COST]` remains until measured. This deterministic test outranks a parser repair requiring wide-count review and large ingestion, uncalibrated numerical starts, and K16 reformulations with no new obstruction.
+
+Numerical admission controls remain required before any search: one deterministic rational source s* with exact coefficient target J*, exact evaluator/projection checks at s*, then at most three fixed perturbations×five damped steps at53 and106 bits under a60-second cap. Record actual costs; “seconds per iteration,” worker-hours and30% recovery are unmeasured. Test the exact zero-J specialization, where the inverse row is −1 for every finite Zj. Also test `(u,uv−1)` along `(ε,1/ε)`: residual tends to zero while coordinates diverge. Log unscaled all-row residual, J0,Zj and coordinate norms. Failed recovery diagnoses the instrument or conditioning, not infeasibility; failed algebraic reconstruction supplies neither exact zero coordinates nor a modular seed.
