+
+**Systems: NO_UPGRADE.** The cleanup already fulfills the48-hour trial. An audit-heading index addresses a documented parser miss, but a stale or incomplete index can create false confidence; complete reading worked here. Durable catch-up lacks an established scheduler dependency, and a contract checker cannot catch this round's algebraic errors. Spending the next15 minutes on the transverse source/code gate has higher mathematical value. No systems implementation is proposed in this exchange.
+
+No new exit-price assertion is made; no charge-basis line applies.
